# JVM options for sbt. These cannot be fixed in our sources:
# - JDK 24+ JEP 498: scala.runtime.LazyVals$ still calls sun.misc.Unsafe::objectFieldOffset
#   (Scala 3.8 uses VarHandles for new code; sbt-launch and older jars still hit LazyVals$).
# - JNA: java.lang.System::load from com.sun.jna.Native
#
# IgnoreUnrecognizedVMOptions keeps this file loadable on JDK 21, which does not know
# --sun-misc-unsafe-memory-access. Put it first.

-J-XX:+IgnoreUnrecognizedVMOptions
-J--add-opens=java.base/sun.misc=ALL-UNNAMED
-J--sun-misc-unsafe-memory-access=allow
-J--enable-native-access=ALL-UNNAMED
